flowchart TD
    GATE[sensitive action] --> CAP{canAuthenticate?}
    CAP -->|success| INIT{init auth-bound cipher ok?}
    INIT -->|invalidated| REKEY[wipe key -> re-provision]
    INIT -->|ok| PROMPT[BiometricPrompt CryptoObject]
    PROMPT -->|succeeded| USE[use unlocked crypto -> proceed]
    PROMPT -->|lockout| CRED[device credential / login]
    PROMPT -->|cancel| ABORT[abort, no change]
    CAP -->|none/no hw| CRED
